{
  "slug": "memoriant-env-bootstrap-skill",
  "name": "Memoriant Env Bootstrap Skill",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Developer environment bootstrap generator for Claude Code. Scans a project for signal files (requirements.txt, package.json, Cargo.toml, Dockerfile, etc.), detects the tech stack, and generates a safe bootstrap.sh script plus ONBOARDING.md checklist for new team members.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **1 skill**, `env-bootstrap` (Scan a project folder for language and dependency signals, then generate a bootstrap.sh setup script and an ONBOARDING.md…) and **1 agent**, `env-bootstrap-agent` (Autonomous agent that scans a project directory for stack signals, generates a bootstrap.sh setup script and ONBOARDING.md checklist,…).\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install memoriant-env-bootstrap-skill@claude-community` from `NathanMaine/memoriant-env-bootstrap-skill`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude",
    "copilot"
  ],
